From 0f91267a7283131f75bd6eb2061932209184ac63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hshadab <hshadab@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 14:53:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(integrations): add ICME Preflight verification stub

Wraps POST /chat with a Preflight verification middleware so every assistant
response can ship with a cryptographic proof receipt (check_id) against a
plain-English policy compiled to SMT-LIB.

- backend/src/lib/preflight.ts     Preflight client (stubbed verify call)
- backend/src/middleware/preflight Express middleware, off|shadow|enforce
- backend/migrations/2026_01_*.sql adds preflight_* columns to chat_messages
- frontend .../VerifiedBadge.tsx   UI pill linking to the public proof URL
- routes/chat.ts                   mounts middleware, persists check_id
- .env.example                     ICME_API_KEY, ICME_POLICY_ID, mode flag

Defaults to shadow mode (records verdicts, never blocks) so existing dev
setups stay functional with no ICME credentials. See INTEGRATIONS/PREFLIGHT.md.
